            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Marathi for red, then the Marathi for blue."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: काळा",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "काळा — kāḷā — \"black\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "काळा (kāḷā) is a tadbhava of Sanskrit kāla, \"black, dark-blue\" (CDIAL 3083). CDIAL derives the Sanskrit word from Dravidian."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
